      "message": "Do we really to have two events here? if it is not handled, it\u0027ll be forwarded below. And we probably don\u0027t need to print any of the cpu_reg again, do we?\n\nHow about we just keep a single event, logged into kvm_host_ffa_handler()\n\nwith the events `func_id` `arg1` `arg2` `arg3` `arg4` `err` `handled`\n\nerr would be one of the FFA error codes and `handled` if we tried to handle it?",
