      "message": "There is also a case where it is not handled because it is rejected. In this case `handled` is true and the error codes are set in the registers from the `kvm_host_ffa_handler` handler. I think we need two of them because the one in `kvm_host_ffa_handler` also logs the arguments of the initial call",
