      "writtenOn": "2024-03-28T12:04:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So we have the following cases:\n\n1. The hypervisor handles it.\n\ntrace_ffa_call - will print the args of the request\ntrace_ffa_call_ret - will print the return codes from the TZ\n\n2. The hypervisor rejects the call.\n\ntrace_ffa_call - will print the args of the request\ntrace_ffa_call_ret - prints the rejected code in which case it is only a0 and a2 register used\n\n3. The hypervisor forwards the call.\n\ntrace_ffa_call and trace_ffa_call_ret will print the same thing. The only difference being the handled argument.\n\nBecause of case 1 we need both of the events. Please let me know if this clarifies or I am missing something.",
